        </button>
        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">Your Open Water certification is a lifetime ticket to explore the underwater world up to 18 meters (60 feet). You can join fun dives around the globe, or continue your education with the Advanced Open Water course to unlock deeper dives and new skills.</div>
